      "content": "i don't want \"perspectives\" or to \"navigate\" anything. it's just so heavy. every morning i wake up and realize i'm just a hollowed out version of what i was meant to be. it feels like i'm just waiting for a clock to run out, but the clock is broken and just dragging me through this misery instead. wouldn't it be more peaceful if i didn't have to feel this nothingness anymore?",
